{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLASE NOTE: The current demo is a very early prototype and does NOT include any of the current story. It also features the old art-style. The new demo will be playable in august during Gamescom 2025.</strong> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>What does the game offer?</strong> \ud83c\udfb6</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Numerous puzzles to solve inside a music box.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A calming soundtrack to enjoy, composed by Jamal Green.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An emotional story to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cozy low poly art (including a cute swan!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 A Short Description \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swan Song is a relaxing puzzle game about music, family &amp; loss. Solve puzzles inside a music box, all the while uncovering the tragic story behind the box, it's maker and his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Gameplay_001.gif?t=1749221591\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 How does it work? \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You solve puzzles by placing notes on your musical scale. After cranking the box, these notes will activate certain platforms when your composition is played. Play them in the right order, and your little swan will make it safely to the exit!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3265290/extras/SwanSong_Gameplay_002.gif?t=1749221591\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udfb6 The Story \ud83c\udfb6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You come across a small music box. Inside it you find all sorts of 